Rule 1 (input and other tensors must have integral or bool dtypes: 0–5)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= 0 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 ∧ 0 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5
>>
Rule 4 (out must be a tensor with the same integral/bool dtype as input; disallow Half)
{v_1: tensor, v_3: tensor} |= dtype_(v_3) = dtype_(v_1) ∧ 0 ≤ dtype_(v_3) ∧ dtype_(v_3) ≤ 5
>>
Rule 5 (input and other tensors must be broadcast-compatible with positive dimensions)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ shape(v_2, i) > 0 ∧ (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1))
>>
Rule 6 (out shape must match input shape)
{v_1: tensor, v_3: tensor} |= ndim(v_3) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i)
